Package: libcamera-metadata
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Camera Metadata library for Qualcomm Linux platform
 This package provides the Camera Metadata shared library, one of
 the basic functionalities for the Linux camera framework.
 .
 Originally from the Android Open Source Project (AOSP), adapted
 for the Qualcomm Innovation Center Linux platform.

Package: libcamera-metadata-dev
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libcamera-metadata (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Camera Metadata library - Development files
 This package provides the Camera Metadata shared library, one of
 the basic functionalities for the Linux camera framework.
 .
 This package contains the development symlink, static library,
 header files, and libtool .la file necessary for software
 development against libcamera_metadata.
